WEBVTT

00:08.897 --> 00:14.657
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:15.157 --> 00:20.747
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:20.747 --> 00:20.787
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:20.787 --> 00:29.337
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:29.337 --> 00:31.207
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:32.587 --> 00:35.137
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:35.467 --> 00:38.967
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:40.467 --> 00:41.807
That's because...
sore wa...

00:43.807 --> 00:46.557
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:46.687 --> 00:49.897
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:51.857 --> 00:52.857
That's the truth.
henne

00:55.407 --> 01:02.117
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:02.447 --> 01:04.457
...with you.
futaride

01:05.457 --> 01:11.167
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:11.837 --> 01:17.257
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:17.467 --> 01:25.767
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:25.767 --> 01:27.597
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:35.497 --> 01:38.087
Hey, Shiratori.

01:38.087 --> 01:42.177
How to make parts
A picture that explains a scene
Encourage anticipation
Your landlady is a high school girl, right?

01:42.177 --> 01:43.387
Y-Yeah.
How to make parts
A picture that explains a scene
Encourage anticipation

01:43.387 --> 01:48.227
I like older girls!

01:48.227 --> 01:50.347
With really nice bodies,

01:50.347 --> 01:52.437
who can teach me many things.

01:52.437 --> 01:54.437
I want that kind of situation!

01:56.067 --> 01:58.777
Living under the same roof.

01:58.777 --> 02:02.197
Eventually, the relationship between the two gets closer!

02:03.487 --> 02:06.407
I envy such an apartment!

02:06.407 --> 02:08.197
So good!

02:08.197 --> 02:10.327
Under the same roof, man!

02:10.327 --> 02:11.707
What do you think, Shiratori?

02:12.957 --> 02:13.627
Oh?

02:17.167 --> 02:19.417
Under the same roof, huh?

02:20.967 --> 02:22.087
Cheers!

02:23.297 --> 02:25.967
I know they mean well, but...

02:30.227 --> 02:33.267
Something's gotta be done about those parties.

02:38.647 --> 02:40.277
I got off one stop too early.

02:42.987 --> 02:43.567
OK!

02:44.197 --> 02:45.737
Ta-da!

02:45.737 --> 02:51.037
We're commencing the Thirteenth Great Exciting Battle for Royal Rights!

02:57.247 --> 03:01.837
Hide and Seek

03:01.837 --> 03:03.217
Today's game is Kakurenbo.
Hide and Seek

03:03.217 --> 03:04.757
Today's game is Kakurenbo.

03:05.007 --> 03:06.387
That is...

03:06.387 --> 03:07.257
Say it!

03:07.927 --> 03:09.637
it's hide and seek.

03:09.637 --> 03:11.227
Correct!

03:11.227 --> 03:14.227
And the winner will, as usual...

03:15.687 --> 03:17.817
...become the king.

03:18.567 --> 03:20.527
The time limit is one hour.

03:20.527 --> 03:23.897
You win if you keep yourself hidden the whole time.

03:23.897 --> 03:26.567
If the person finds all the members, he wins.

03:27.447 --> 03:29.577
If there are multiple people who can keep themselves hidden,

03:29.577 --> 03:32.287
they all become king,

03:32.907 --> 03:35.497
and will be awarded a Royalty Ticket!

03:36.117 --> 03:38.747
Um, what is a Royalty Ticket?

03:38.747 --> 03:39.997
Good question.

03:39.997 --> 03:41.257
Ta-da!

03:41.257 --> 03:42.507
Specially made by me!

03:42.507 --> 03:42.757
This is a Royalty Ticket!

03:42.757 --> 03:44.507
A Coupon to become King by Momo
This is a Royalty Ticket!

03:44.507 --> 03:44.837
This is a Royalty Ticket!

03:46.887 --> 03:48.967
Your handwriting sucks.

03:48.967 --> 03:51.057
Your drawing is bad, too.

03:51.717 --> 03:57.517
Anyone who gets this ticket presented to them must obey the king's orders.

03:57.517 --> 03:59.937
That's rough.

04:00.267 --> 04:02.397
What should I order?

04:02.397 --> 04:03.817
I can't wait.

04:03.817 --> 04:05.897
We'll get it this time.

04:05.897 --> 04:09.197
Now, does anyone have any questions?

04:09.197 --> 04:10.197
Oh, yes.

04:10.617 --> 04:11.577
Yes, Shiratori-kun.

04:11.577 --> 04:14.327
What happens if I don't participate?

04:14.327 --> 04:17.537
Of course, you're considered an automatic loser.

04:17.537 --> 04:18.577
I knew it.

04:19.127 --> 04:20.457
Oh, yes!

04:20.457 --> 04:24.877
Today, we'll make it special: you're it, Shiratori-kun.

04:24.877 --> 04:26.967
No way!

04:26.967 --> 04:33.467
I thought maybe you were getting tired of parties every night.

04:33.467 --> 04:38.267
And we all hoped that you would get to know Narutakisou better.

04:38.897 --> 04:41.857
You're not very convincing.

04:41.857 --> 04:44.777
You're really resisting today.

04:47.277 --> 04:49.907
What are you all doing, congregating here?

04:50.237 --> 04:51.577
Oh, Kozue-chan!

04:51.577 --> 04:52.407
Miss Landlady!

04:52.407 --> 04:53.407
Good timing!

04:53.407 --> 04:56.657
We were just about to play the usual game.

04:56.657 --> 04:58.287
Do you want to play, too?

04:58.287 --> 04:59.747
Yes, please!

05:00.377 --> 05:02.337
Are you sure, Miss Landlady?

05:02.337 --> 05:03.417
What's wrong?

05:03.417 --> 05:06.917
We're playing hide and seek using your apartments!

05:06.917 --> 05:10.087
Oh, it's hide and seek this time!

05:10.087 --> 05:12.427
That sounds fun!

05:13.757 --> 05:17.017
I know you can't betray her smile.

05:17.017 --> 05:18.977
You just have to win it.

05:20.517 --> 05:22.937
You have no right to deny it, so enjoy it!

05:22.937 --> 05:24.147
Enjoy!

05:25.397 --> 05:29.147
If I win, I can use the Royalty Ticket and make an order.

05:29.147 --> 05:33.077
That means I can forbid any parties in my room.

05:33.077 --> 05:35.487
I can spend more time working on my homework!

05:35.787 --> 05:36.787
Let's go!

05:42.917 --> 05:45.497
I must win this game!

05:45.837 --> 05:46.547
I'll win!

05:46.547 --> 05:48.297
You're finally up to it.
I'll win!

05:48.297 --> 05:51.297
It's easy to see what he's thinking.
I'll win!

05:51.927 --> 05:56.387
Everyone, I want you to abide by these three rules.

05:56.387 --> 05:57.217
First!

05:57.217 --> 06:00.347
No one shall move from his original hiding spot.

06:01.477 --> 06:02.397
Second!

06:02.397 --> 06:05.227
Anyone who gets captured shall not disturb me.

06:06.317 --> 06:07.187
Third!

06:07.187 --> 06:10.897
If you hide in a room, don't lock the door.

06:11.527 --> 06:12.817
Understood?

06:15.157 --> 06:18.407
He's kind of cool today.

06:20.407 --> 06:23.037
The seeker shall wait outside for five minutes!

06:23.577 --> 06:24.707
Are you ready?

06:24.707 --> 06:27.797
Let's start!

06:39.307 --> 06:42.347
5 minutes later

06:43.807 --> 06:44.977
Here I come!

06:45.897 --> 06:49.567
Narutakisou is actually pretty big.

06:49.857 --> 06:52.447
Anyway, I will look in all the rooms.

06:56.277 --> 06:58.657
Shiratori Ryushi Search Started

07:00.367 --> 07:01.327
No abnormalities.

07:04.037 --> 07:06.167
So these two were storage rooms.

07:07.707 --> 07:09.587
This is the landlady's room.

07:11.167 --> 07:12.927
It's locked.

07:12.927 --> 07:14.587
Nobody's in there.

07:19.177 --> 07:21.977
Apartment 1 is Tamami-chan's.

07:31.357 --> 07:33.487
Oh my.

07:35.237 --> 07:36.987
That shouldn't happen.

07:37.777 --> 07:39.537
Even Tamami-chan wouldn't...

07:45.037 --> 07:48.167
Honestly, I'm glad it's locked.

07:48.167 --> 07:52.087
Even though it's a game, I get nervous about entering a girl's room.

07:52.547 --> 07:53.837
This is my room.

07:53.837 --> 07:56.797
I locked the door when I went to school this morning, so it's okay.

07:59.137 --> 08:00.257
Why does it open?

08:00.257 --> 08:00.847
Why?

08:00.847 --> 08:01.517
How come?

08:01.517 --> 08:02.347
What for?

08:02.927 --> 08:05.347
I locked it this morning.

08:10.567 --> 08:12.857
Why are you sleeping in my room?

08:14.737 --> 08:16.407
Momono Megumi - Captured

08:16.737 --> 08:18.697
This is my room.

08:19.447 --> 08:21.117
We were partying all night,

08:21.117 --> 08:23.407
so I was short on sleep.

08:23.407 --> 08:26.457
Still! Don't sleep in my room!

08:26.457 --> 08:27.997
How did you get in!?

08:27.997 --> 08:29.837
Leave that for later.

08:29.837 --> 08:31.917
Time won't wait for you.

08:32.337 --> 08:34.507
The next spot!

08:34.507 --> 08:37.797
From here on, I'll be the play-by-play analyst!

08:37.797 --> 08:39.087
I don't need you.

08:39.087 --> 08:41.677
And don't disturb me.

08:41.927 --> 08:44.177
Apartment 3 is locked, too.

08:44.517 --> 08:46.767
This is my room.

08:48.397 --> 08:50.227
Bathroom, all clear.

08:52.897 --> 08:54.987
Men's locker room, all clear.

08:56.737 --> 08:58.277
Washroom, all clear.

08:59.777 --> 09:01.367
H-hey,

09:01.867 --> 09:03.077
Shiratori-kun,

09:03.787 --> 09:07.157
are you going to look in the girl's bathroom too?

09:07.157 --> 09:10.127
That's the room where we get naked every day.

09:10.827 --> 09:13.997
It's embarrassing that a boy would look inside.

09:14.837 --> 09:17.547
Women's locker room and bathroom, both clear.

09:19.047 --> 09:21.257
Let's see, it's the toilet next.

09:21.257 --> 09:23.847
Oh, jeez! That's so mean, Shiratori-kun!

09:23.847 --> 09:27.847
You didn't even hesitate to enter the girl's room!

09:27.847 --> 09:29.647
What are you talking about?

09:30.597 --> 09:32.437
This is hide and seek.

09:32.437 --> 09:34.727
To search from corner to corner...

09:35.647 --> 09:37.027
That's common sense.

09:41.367 --> 09:43.867
Shiratori-kun is serious today.

09:47.247 --> 09:48.577
Nobody in the toilet either.

09:48.577 --> 09:50.037
Wait, Shiratori-kun.

09:50.037 --> 09:52.287
Did you look inside the bowls, too?

09:52.287 --> 09:56.047
There might be someone hiding like this!

09:56.667 --> 09:59.417
Let's see, the kitchen and the pantry next.

09:59.417 --> 10:01.387
What!?

10:01.387 --> 10:02.717
Don't ignore me!

10:02.717 --> 10:04.047
That's no fun.

10:04.047 --> 10:06.267
You could play along with me, too.

10:10.057 --> 10:12.227
No problem in the kitchen either.

10:14.147 --> 10:15.647
Apartment 4 is next, right?

10:15.647 --> 10:16.567
Apartment 4!

10:28.327 --> 10:31.497
Momono-san, you're not disturbing me, are you?

10:31.747 --> 10:33.577
Of course not!

10:33.577 --> 10:35.497
Come on!

10:35.497 --> 10:36.747
I thought so.

10:38.087 --> 10:39.457
Oh, yes.

10:39.457 --> 10:42.627
You left your sake in the kitchen.

10:42.627 --> 10:44.007
Oh, sake?

10:44.007 --> 10:47.057
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

10:47.807 --> 10:48.967
Dang it!

11:02.147 --> 11:04.067
Kurosaki Sayoko - Captured

11:14.537 --> 11:16.787
Time Remaining 40 Minutes

11:19.707 --> 11:21.087
Apartment 4...

11:21.087 --> 11:23.047
Whose room is this?

11:24.637 --> 11:26.847
Nobody is supposed to be in there, but...

11:26.847 --> 11:27.507
But?

11:27.967 --> 11:31.767
Occasionally, you can hear whispers coming from that room.

11:31.767 --> 11:34.937
This room is the mystery spot of Narutakisou.

11:38.357 --> 11:38.897
Good.

11:38.897 --> 11:40.107
It's locked.

11:40.107 --> 11:41.147
No problem.

11:41.897 --> 11:44.447
I can't trick Shiratori-kun today.

11:44.447 --> 11:45.777
It's haunted?

11:45.777 --> 11:47.737
I didn't know.

11:47.737 --> 11:49.867
That was a lie.

11:53.247 --> 11:55.707
Apartment 5 is the Kurosaki family's room.

11:56.877 --> 11:57.877
It's open.

11:59.287 --> 12:02.007
Sayoko-san has already been captured, so...

12:02.547 --> 12:05.257
...there is a high possibility of Asami-chan hiding inside!

12:06.047 --> 12:07.717
It's a rule of hide and seek.

12:07.717 --> 12:10.597
Excuse me, but let me enter the room.

12:11.137 --> 12:11.967
Go ahead.

12:12.307 --> 12:15.057
OK, excuse me!

12:17.057 --> 12:20.017
I was just in this room the other day.

12:22.647 --> 12:26.107
I'm sorry, but I can't lose this game!

12:26.107 --> 12:27.987
Onii-chan!

12:27.987 --> 12:29.777
I'm sorry, Asami-chan!

12:33.247 --> 12:35.707
I think there are more boxes than before.

12:37.367 --> 12:40.457
In a pinch, I might have to get involved with their jobs again.

12:44.717 --> 12:48.927
Looking through all these would be hard.

12:50.097 --> 12:51.347
Yes.

12:51.347 --> 12:55.227
The only box big enough for Asami-chan to hide inside of is...

12:57.767 --> 12:59.477
Maybe, just maybe...

12:59.477 --> 13:00.557
So light!

13:00.557 --> 13:03.687
Obviously she's not in that.

13:04.647 --> 13:08.067
That means she's hiding behind some boxes?

13:10.657 --> 13:12.027
Oh, no.

13:25.547 --> 13:28.007
Asami-chan, right?

13:33.677 --> 13:36.597
Too bad, you found me.

13:36.927 --> 13:39.437
Kurosaki Asami - Captured

13:39.727 --> 13:40.147
You hid so well.

13:40.147 --> 13:41.727
She made holes in the boxes, and...
You hid so well.

13:41.727 --> 13:42.517
Good job.
She made holes in the boxes, and...

13:42.517 --> 13:43.607
She's pretty clever.
Good job.

13:43.607 --> 13:44.567
She's pretty clever.

13:45.897 --> 13:47.107
Apartment 6.

13:47.107 --> 13:49.237
This is Haibara-san's room, right?

13:50.487 --> 13:51.527
No good.

13:51.527 --> 13:52.067
Next!

13:53.077 --> 13:54.577
This is the last room!

13:54.577 --> 13:56.997
Nobody lives in Apartment 7.

13:58.077 --> 13:59.917
It's locked.

13:59.917 --> 14:02.837
There are no more rooms in Narutakisou, are there?

14:02.837 --> 14:05.337
There aren't any hidden rooms, right?

14:05.337 --> 14:08.217
We don't have anything like that.

14:08.217 --> 14:09.507
No way...

14:12.547 --> 14:15.427
Time Remaining 20 Minutes

14:17.717 --> 14:20.097
Where else am I supposed to look?

14:44.627 --> 14:46.167
You found us!

14:46.167 --> 14:48.957
It's all because he doesn't have enough guts!

14:48.957 --> 14:49.627
Damn!

14:49.627 --> 14:50.297
Haibara, Damn!

14:50.297 --> 14:52.007
Shooting Star Johnny (Haibara Yukio) - Captured
Haibara, Damn!

14:52.007 --> 14:53.467
Shooting Star Johnny (Haibara Yukio) - Captured

14:54.007 --> 14:57.137
Haibara-san hid like there was no tomorrow.

14:57.137 --> 14:59.557
Nobody can match that.

14:59.557 --> 15:00.927
You think so?

15:03.017 --> 15:04.517
Shiratori-kun!

15:04.517 --> 15:06.817
You have less than 10 minutes left!

15:06.817 --> 15:08.647
I know!

15:08.647 --> 15:12.697
After all that, I still haven't found the toughest enemy!

15:12.697 --> 15:13.947
My, my.

15:13.947 --> 15:16.157
Find me quickly.

15:16.157 --> 15:19.747
It's not easy hiding for so long.

15:19.747 --> 15:19.867
Uhuhuhuhu
It's not easy hiding for so long.

15:19.867 --> 15:22.617
Uhuhuhuhu

15:23.167 --> 15:26.377
There is no victory without winning against her!

15:26.377 --> 15:28.587
Win, and capture freedom!

15:29.917 --> 15:32.717
Look, win no matter what!

15:33.507 --> 15:34.467
I want to win.

15:35.137 --> 15:36.087
I want to win.

15:37.047 --> 15:37.887
I want to win.

15:38.807 --> 15:39.637
I want to win.

15:41.017 --> 15:41.927
I want to win!

15:42.597 --> 15:44.227
But that's strange.

15:45.267 --> 15:47.897
There are no more places to hide.

15:49.317 --> 15:51.437
Why can't I find Tamami-chan?

15:52.187 --> 15:53.197
Could it be!?

15:53.737 --> 15:56.777
Did she get out of the apartment area?

15:58.077 --> 16:00.947
I don't break the rules.

16:00.947 --> 16:02.697
Would you like to give up?

16:06.877 --> 16:08.997
There is a spot I haven't...

16:09.587 --> 16:10.457
...looked!

16:15.967 --> 16:16.927
It's not safe up there.

16:16.927 --> 16:18.847
Don't do it.

16:18.847 --> 16:20.097
No, I'm going.

16:20.097 --> 16:21.597
Please let me.

16:21.597 --> 16:23.477
This is the only place left.

16:28.397 --> 16:30.227
I have my doubts, but...

16:31.017 --> 16:33.527
No Tamami-chan might do it!

16:34.357 --> 16:36.447
I've cornered you, Tamami-chan!

16:37.277 --> 16:40.237
He wants to become the king that badly?

16:40.237 --> 16:41.237
Probably.

16:41.237 --> 16:44.957
Onii-chan is so cool today!

16:49.077 --> 16:49.997
Where?

16:49.997 --> 16:51.797
Where is she!?

16:56.507 --> 16:59.087
Is he gonna be okay?

16:59.087 --> 17:01.557
He's still so cool.

17:08.687 --> 17:10.357
Tamami-chan, found you!

17:17.737 --> 17:19.527
Oh, my.

17:19.527 --> 17:21.947
You found me.

17:22.327 --> 17:25.327
Chanohata Tamami - Captured

17:25.577 --> 17:26.827
I did it!

17:27.497 --> 17:29.877
I won!

17:30.747 --> 17:33.587
Coincidence is scary.

17:33.587 --> 17:36.087
I only had a little while to go.

17:36.087 --> 17:38.507
Tama-chan got found, eh?

17:38.507 --> 17:39.677
That can actually happen...

17:39.677 --> 17:40.427
Now I'm the king!
That can actually happen...

17:40.427 --> 17:41.717
Now I'm the king!

17:42.797 --> 17:45.557
I can prohibit all of the parties in my room!

17:45.927 --> 17:49.767
Remaining - One Member

17:49.767 --> 17:50.767
Huh?
Remaining - One Member

17:51.147 --> 17:53.517
One, two, three...

17:53.517 --> 17:54.607
...four...

17:56.687 --> 17:58.987
Miss Landlady is missing!

17:59.527 --> 18:04.277
At this rate, she'll win!

18:05.287 --> 18:09.407
But I can't imagine her giving out a mean order with the ticket.

18:09.747 --> 18:12.077
Maybe I can lose.

18:12.667 --> 18:14.037
No, I can't!

18:14.037 --> 18:14.917
I've come this far!

18:15.377 --> 18:17.917
I will get my peaceful days with the Royalty Ticket!

18:19.047 --> 18:20.587
I'm sorry, Miss Landlady!

18:24.007 --> 18:25.927
Time is up!

18:36.567 --> 18:41.737
Today's winner for the Royalty Ticket Hide and Seek is...

18:41.737 --> 18:43.657
Aoba Kozue!

18:46.077 --> 18:47.617
No way...

18:48.287 --> 18:52.077
Kozue-chan, you can come out now.

19:00.667 --> 19:02.007
T-Thank you.

19:06.597 --> 19:11.767
It's the camouflage pillar that I made for times like this.

19:11.767 --> 19:13.977
Wow! It looks real!

19:13.977 --> 19:16.727
Why didn't you use it yourself?

19:17.227 --> 19:20.567
I wanted her to win.

19:20.567 --> 19:23.907
I was being a decoy of sorts.

19:25.657 --> 19:28.407
You love Kozue-chan so much.

19:28.407 --> 19:31.707
Shiratori-kun didn't stand a chance against your teamwork.

19:32.207 --> 19:33.917
Of course not.

19:34.497 --> 19:36.287
Well, that's the game.

19:36.287 --> 19:38.667
Now, in celebration of Kozue-chan's victory.

19:38.667 --> 19:41.877
let's party hard in Shiratori-kun's room!

19:41.877 --> 19:43.877
Yes, let's!

19:44.967 --> 19:48.967
That's how it ends, after all.

19:57.647 --> 20:00.687
We partied again last night.

20:07.237 --> 20:09.617
It's a nice morning.

20:09.617 --> 20:12.537
I wish something nice would happen on such a nice day.

20:12.537 --> 20:14.247
Good morning.

20:15.247 --> 20:16.877
Good morning.

20:18.497 --> 20:19.247
Um,

20:20.377 --> 20:21.877
Shiratori-san.

20:21.877 --> 20:22.417
Yes?

20:23.087 --> 20:26.087
May I use this on you?

20:27.547 --> 20:29.387
The Royalty Ticket...

20:30.137 --> 20:31.387
...from yesterday?

20:31.807 --> 20:32.557
Yes.

20:32.557 --> 20:36.897
Please let me use it.

20:36.897 --> 20:38.057
On me?

20:40.187 --> 20:42.227
Sure.

20:43.937 --> 20:45.987
What is she going to ask?

20:47.067 --> 20:52.737
Then, would you come shopping with me this Sunday?

20:54.537 --> 20:57.417
Do you have plans for Sunday already?

20:57.417 --> 20:59.127
No, I don't.

20:59.787 --> 21:01.297
Really?

21:01.297 --> 21:03.127
Good.

21:03.507 --> 21:05.757
Thank you.

21:06.377 --> 21:07.627
Y-Yeah.

21:13.807 --> 21:17.187
So what she wanted was a shopping trip.

21:17.187 --> 21:19.437
Thank goodness that's all she wants.

21:27.027 --> 21:29.737
Alone with me?

21:30.617 --> 21:33.287
Does that mean...

21:34.157 --> 21:35.287
...a date!?

21:35.867 --> 21:37.077
With Miss Landlady?

21:38.917 --> 21:40.707
So that's how she played it.

21:52.427 --> 21:58.937
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

21:59.017 --> 22:04.737
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:06.157 --> 22:12.617
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:12.867 --> 22:17.917
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:19.877 --> 22:26.627
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:26.877 --> 22:32.557
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:33.557 --> 22:39.397
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:39.397 --> 22:41.647
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:41.857 --> 22:48.027
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:48.527 --> 22:54.367
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

22:54.367 --> 22:58.997
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

